#: source/how-to/write_articulation_cfg.rst:323
msgid "Example: configure and run two robots"
msgstr "示例：配置并运行两个机器人"

#: source/how-to/write_articulation_cfg.rst:325
msgid ""
"The runnable example ``scripts/tutorials/01_assets/add_new_robot.py`` "
"contrasts a minimal Jetbot configuration with a more detailed Dofbot "
"configuration. Start with an imported USD asset (see "
":doc:`import_new_asset`) and define its spawn properties and actuators. "
"Jetbot retains the joint gains authored in the USD by setting stiffness and "
"damping to ``None``. Both fields must be specified, even when using these "
"USD defaults:"
msgstr ""
"可运行示例 ``scripts/tutorials/01_assets/add_new_robot.py`` 对比了精简的 Jetbot 配置与较详细的"
" Dofbot 配置。从导入的 USD 资产开始（见 :doc:`import_new_asset` ），定义生成属性和执行器。Jetbot "
"将刚度与阻尼设为 ``None`` ，保留 USD 中编写的关节增益。即使使用这些 USD 默认值，也必须指定这两个字段："

#: source/how-to/write_articulation_cfg.rst:336
msgid ""
"Dofbot additionally sets initial joint positions, groups joints by name, and"
" specifies actuator gains and limits. Its solver iterations and maximum "
"depenetration velocity are PhysX-specific; use :ref:`asset-config-backends` "
"when adapting these properties to Newton. The keys in "
"``init_state.joint_pos`` identify USD joints, not actuator groups. Joint "
"names can be matched with regular expressions; for example, ``.*`` selects "
"all joints."
msgstr ""
"Dofbot 还设置了初始关节位置、按名称分组的关节，以及执行器增益和限制。其中求解迭代次数与最大去穿透速度是 PhysX 专用属性；适配 Newton"
" 时参阅 :ref:`asset-config-backends` 。 ``init_state.joint_pos`` 中的键标识 USD "
"关节，而非执行器组。关节名可以用正则表达式匹配，例如 ``.*`` 选择所有关节。"

#: source/how-to/write_articulation_cfg.rst:0
msgid "Expanded Dofbot configuration from the runnable example"
msgstr "可运行示例中的完整 Dofbot 配置"

#: source/how-to/write_articulation_cfg.rst:350
msgid ""
"The example adds both configurations to an ``InteractiveSceneCfg``, assigns "
"each robot a path under every environment, and constructs the scene. Its "
"loop resets root and joint states, sets joint targets, writes commands, "
"steps physics, and updates the scene buffers. See :ref:`tutorial-"
"interactive-scene` for scene construction and :ref:`tutorial-interact-"
"articulation` for the reset and control loop."
msgstr ""
"示例将两个配置添加到 ``InteractiveSceneCfg`` "
"，为各环境中的机器人指定路径，并构建场景。循环依次重置根状态与关节状态、设置关节目标、写入命令、推进物理并更新场景缓冲区。场景构建见 "
":ref:`tutorial-interactive-scene` ，重置与控制循环见 :ref:`tutorial-interact-"
"articulation` 。"

